flowchart LR
    W[Own website webhook] --> API[NestJS API and adapters]
    N[Nykaa webhook] --> API
    B[Blinkit webhook] --> API
    F[Flipkart poller every 2 min] --> API
    API --> Q[(AWS SQS order events)]
    Q --> OW[Order and inventory workers]
    OW <--> DB[(PostgreSQL: orders, inventory, reservations, audit, outbox)]
    DB --> OD[Outbox dispatcher]
    OD --> SQ[(SQS stock sync jobs)]
    SQ --> SP[Stock publisher workers]
    SP <--> R[(Redis: rate limits/cache)]
    SP --> W
    SP --> N
    SP --> F
    SP --> B
    OD --> EQ[(SQS ERP delivery)]
    EQ --> EW[ERP worker]
    EW --> ERP[Microsoft Business Central]
    OW --> OPS[Ops screen: failed syncs and retry]
    SP --> OPS
    EW --> OPS
    API --> OBS[Metrics, logs and alerts]
    DB --> OBS
    SP --> OBS
    EW --> OBS
